  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7266101",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to the Mondstadt fisherman Nantuck",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "726610101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "726610101": {
            "id": "726610101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Nantuck",
            "text": "Hey, young fisherman, I'm glad to see you. What's up, have you run into some trouble?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610102"
            ]
          },
          "726610102": {
            "id": "726610102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Nantuck",
            "text": "Come come, I am your experienced angling guide. You can let me know about any issues you're having.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610103"
            ]
          },
          "726610103": {
            "id": "726610103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Nantuck",
            "text": "It makes sense that Kujirai is still obsessed with finding the \"Lunar Leviathan\" as her wish is...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610104"
            ]
          },
          "726610104": {
            "id": "726610104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Nantuck",
            "text": "Alas, if she knew the truth about the \"Lunar Leviathan\" she would be devastated.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610105"
            ]
          },
          "726610105": {
            "id": "726610105",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What truth?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610106"
            ]
          },
          "726610106": {
            "id": "726610106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Nantuck",
            "text": "To be truthful, after from returning from the voyage, I did not stop researching about the \"Lunar Leviathan\". I finally found a clue in an ancient book.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610107"
            ]
          },
          "726610107": {
            "id": "726610107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Nantuck",
            "text": "Based on those clues, I went back out on the field and found out some shocking revelations.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610108"
            ]
          },
          "726610108": {
            "id": "726610108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Nantuck",
            "text": "I published my findings in a book, I heard it's doing well recently.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610109"
            ]
          },
          "726610109": {
            "id": "726610109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Nantuck",
            "text": "Here, I just happen to have a book left by the editor. The truth about the \"Lunar Leviathan\" is inside.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610110"
            ]
          },
          "726610110": {
            "id": "726610110",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon wants to see too! Let Paimon get a look!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610111"
            ]
          },
          "726610111": {
            "id": "726610111",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "\"Regarding How The Lunar Leviathan Is Actually A Giant Sea Turtle\" ... What a long title... Huh?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610112"
            ]
          },
          "726610112": {
            "id": "726610112",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "A giant sea turtle? The \"Lunar Leviathan\" is a giant sea turtle?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610113"
            ]
          },
          "726610113": {
            "id": "726610113",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Nantuck",
            "text": "That's right, the \"Lunar Leviathan\" is a giant sea turtle.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610114"
            ]
          },
          "726610114": {
            "id": "726610114",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Nantuck",
            "text": "That night, what we saw was a giant sea turtle with long bioluminescent plants growing on its back.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610115"
            ]
          },
          "726610115": {
            "id": "726610115",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Nantuck",
            "text": "It was a pregnant sea turtle that was looking for land to lay her eggs, which was how we found our way home.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610116"
            ]
          },
          "726610116": {
            "id": "726610116",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Nantuck",
            "text": "So go back and tell Kujirai, you eventually have to face the facts.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610117"
            ]
          },
          "726610117": {
            "id": "726610117",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "But, maybe this can be explained...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610118"
            ]
          },
          "726610118": {
            "id": "726610118",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Nantuck",
            "text": "Seeing your expression, you probably don't believe me huh? But my research has evidence to back it up.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610119"
            ]
          },
          "726610119": {
            "id": "726610119",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Nantuck",
            "text": "In the ancient tales, the \"Lunar Leviathan\" is an ancient creature, back when many animals lived on land.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610120"
            ]
          },
          "726610120": {
            "id": "726610120",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Nantuck",
            "text": "Their ancestors were active in the Dragonspine area and you can even find fossils of them today.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610121"
            ]
          },
          "726610121": {
            "id": "726610121",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Nantuck",
            "text": "I found some last time in <color=#00E1FFFF>Wyrmrest Valley</color>. If you don't believe me you can go see for yourself."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
