    {
      "subId": "7266109",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Kujirai Momiji",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "726610601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "726610601": {
            "id": "726610601",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Kujirai Momiji",
            "text": "You guys are finally back, eh? Jiawei didn't come?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610602"
            ]
          },
          "726610602": {
            "id": "726610602",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "He stayed in the village.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610603"
            ]
          },
          "726610603": {
            "id": "726610603",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Kujirai Momiji",
            "text": "Oh? He's become a family man? Haha! That seems like something he would do.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610604"
            ]
          },
          "726610604": {
            "id": "726610604",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Kujirai Momiji",
            "text": "After all, that was his wish...alright, for this reason, he is forgiven.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610605"
            ]
          },
          "726610605": {
            "id": "726610605",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Kujirai Momiji",
            "text": "What about Nantuck? Did you guys find him?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610606"
            ]
          },
          "726610606": {
            "id": "726610606",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "He wrote a Best-Selling book.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610607"
            ]
          },
          "726610607": {
            "id": "726610607",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Kujirai Momiji",
            "text": "Never thought he'd actually be a writer, huh? Pretty talented, so what did he write about?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610608"
            ]
          },
          "726610608": {
            "id": "726610608",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon knows! Paimon knows! The books called \"Regarding How The Lunar Leviathan Is Actually A Giant Sea Turtle\".",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610609"
            ]
          },
          "726610609": {
            "id": "726610609",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Kujirai Momiji",
            "text": "Oh, that's a long name...is it a light novel? Not bad... I'll go buy a copy and read it too... Hmm? Wait a minute.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610610"
            ]
          },
          "726610610": {
            "id": "726610610",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Kujirai Momiji",
            "text": "\"Regarding How The Lunar Leviathan Is Actually...\" It's actually a...?!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610611"
            ]
          },
          "726610611": {
            "id": "726610611",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Mmhmm, it's actually a giant sea turtle.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610612"
            ]
          },
          "726610612": {
            "id": "726610612",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Kujirai Momiji",
            "text": "What is this guy talking about? How could it be a giant sea turtle? Did he forget that we saw the \"Lunar Leviathan\" with our own eyes?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610613"
            ]
          },
          "726610613": {
            "id": "726610613",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We didn't believe it at first...until we went to the snowy mountains and found the fossil of the \"Lunar Leviathan\"... Here you go, the book and the fossil.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610614"
            ]
          },
          "726610614": {
            "id": "726610614",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Kujirai Momiji",
            "text": "No, I don't believe this. It's not true...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610615"
            ]
          },
          "726610615": {
            "id": "726610615",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Kujirai Momiji",
            "text": "You don't understand, our family comes from a long lineage of fishermen, and my father is also a famous fisherman in Inazuma.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610616"
            ]
          },
          "726610616": {
            "id": "726610616",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Kujirai Momiji",
            "text": "He had spent decades chasing the \"Lunar Leviathan\" on the ocean, and once, he almost succeeded.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610617"
            ]
          },
          "726610617": {
            "id": "726610617",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Kujirai Momiji",
            "text": "Although it was all for naught, my father didn't give up. It would be a great honor for a fisherman if he could catch the legendary \"Lunar Leviathan.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610618"
            ]
          },
          "726610618": {
            "id": "726610618",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Kujirai Momiji",
            "text": "But after the next trip to sea...he never came back.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610619"
            ]
          },
          "726610619": {
            "id": "726610619",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Kujirai Momiji",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610620"
            ]
          },
          "726610620": {
            "id": "726610620",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Kujirai Momiji",
            "text": "So, I won't believe such words easily, please help me out!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610621"
            ]
          },
          "726610621": {
            "id": "726610621",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What do you plan to do then?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610622"
            ]
          },
          "726610622": {
            "id": "726610622",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Kujirai Momiji",
            "text": "I'm going back to find the items my father left behind. He chased the \"Lunar Leviathan\" all his life and left a lot of information behind. I'm sure I can find a way.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726610623"
            ]
          },
          "726610623": {
            "id": "726610623",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Kujirai Momiji",
            "text": "I have prepared some fishing training for you, please wait for my good news, I will have to ask you for help then."
          }
        }
      }
    },
